{"id":"1stact_level_a001_03_beg","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"delay":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"Ngh..."},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"You... you took out all my buddies?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"delay":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"...S-stay away from me! I'm begging you!"},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"I, I'll give you all my coins! My weapons! Anything you want..."},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"Where's the girl?"},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"What are you talking about...?"},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"Don't come any closer...!"},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"You monster—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Clear \\ Visibility: 14 km"},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Forest at the foot of Mt. Terrat"},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_forest","fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop","volume":0.6,"crossfade":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"This rock..."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Stay close to me, you two. Watch your step, and stay inside my footprints. Don't go around touching things either."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"I'm afraid this forest is even more dangerous than we suspected."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Is something carved on that rock?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"These are marks left behind by bounty hunters. We need to take heed of these, or we may well end up stepping in a trap."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"So, how are we going to avoid the traps?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Just watch me."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"An animal trap on a rope... how old-fashioned."},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Here's a rolling log trap, hidden by the foliage. Would've tripped it if we rushed forward."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Miss Carol, watch your step."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"avg_npc_003","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Carol","text":"Uh, huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"avg_npc_003","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"If you take another step in that direction, there's probably a spiked pitfall waiting for you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"avg_npc_003","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Carol","text":"Oh...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"You sure are the real deal. You're pretty good at this."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Of course. After all, I used to..."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"It's not realistic to go around all the traps. Looks like we'll have to disarm some of them after all."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"The most perilous path for them will soon become the safest path for us."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Let's go."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop","volume":0.6,"crossfade":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Wait."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Something's not right here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Is it a trap?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"No..."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"A symbol drawn with blood..."},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"'...Monster?'"},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"What's the meaning of this? In all my years, I've never seen a symbol like this."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"...Oh..."},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Is this what I think it is..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"Monster... Monster!"},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"D-don't come this way!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#1","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"???","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"It was you!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2","name2":"char_220_grani#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Skadi, you're Skadi, right?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2","name2":"char_220_grani#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"...So, the chief of Dewville was with you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Huh? You know Carol...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Hand her over to me. Now."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Grani, something's not right about her eyes."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"I can't just do that. Let's talk this over peacefully—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"H-huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Oww!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_bat_indust_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_bat_indust_loop","volume":0.6,"crossfade":1.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"That was just a warning."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"No! Miss Carol, Big Bob..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Wh-why would she attack you?"},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"You know each other right, so why—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010","name2":"char_220_grani#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"No time to explain! Run for it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"*gasp* *gasp*... Is she still after us?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_003"}},{"t":"line","name":"Carol","text":"G-Grani... I, I can't run for any longer..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"That woman... is she really a monster? She's not even short of breath!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2","fadetime":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Why must I waste my time on you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_skill/e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"She's really gonna kill me! Whoa, what is she doing to Miss Carol?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_003"}},{"t":"line","name":"Carol","text":"Her eyes, they're so red... G-Grani!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"No, no, no! This can't be happening!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Stop!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"Ambush!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"'Captain'","text":"Now! Fiiire!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"Hmm?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_008"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Captain'","text":"That's her right there, the walking Catastrophe! Hurry, shoot her down!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Stop it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_008"}},{"t":"line","name":"'Captain'","text":"What do you think you're doing, kid?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"I don't know why she's after us, but she's still my coworker!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_008"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_defboost"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"line","name":"'Captain'","text":"G-get out of my way, you rascal—!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_220_grani#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Grani","text":"Hurry up and run!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_010"}},{"t":"line","name":"Big Bob","text":"—There's an opening to the east! Hurry!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_007","name2":"avg_npc_007"}},{"t":"line","name":"Bounty Hunter","text":"No way we're letting you escape! Die, monster!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_263_skadi#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Skadi","text":"(Ægirian) Scatter and fall!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
